	"Description": "A recolor mod of the 8 festivals.\n<br />It adds animation to some of the decorations and randomized some of them as well.\n<br />\n<br />In the config, you can also decide to turn off any specific\u00A0festivals recolor incase you don't like them. By default they are all on.\n<br />All of the assets are separated to make it easier to change decorations for a specific festival. Feel free to edit them as you wish.\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />This mod should work with Map Recolors:\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/6367]Vibrant Pastoral Recolor[/url]\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1869]Starblue Valley World Recolor [/url]\n<br />eemie Map Recolour\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5255]DaisyNiko's Earthy Recolour[/url]\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2995]A Wittily Named Recolor\n<br />[/url]\n<br />If there is a map recolor you would like added to the dependencies, let me know. I just used the ones I use and know of.",
